      "options": {
        "content": "### Quality\n\nThe #1 trust question: does AI speed come at the cost of more rework?\n\n- **Good scenario**: time-to-merge down, changes-requested stable/declining, approval ratio high.\n- **Bad scenario**: changes-requested and decline rates climb after rollout — the team ships fast and fixes slow. ROI craters regardless of adoption.\n- Advice: pair telemetry with **peer review** culture; watch the QA-impaired-to-ideal ratio before crediting throughput gains.",
